{"path":"header/source_location","title":"Standard library header <source_location> (C++20)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">Standard library header</span> &lt;source_location&gt;&nbsp;<span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/header/source_location","section":"header","kind":"page","summary":"This header is part of the utility library.","html":"<p>This header is part of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility\">utility</a> library.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h3 id=\"Classes\">Classes</h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/source_location\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>source_location</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  a class representing information about the source code, such as file names, line numbers, and function names <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> source_location<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"Class_std::source_location\">Class <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/source_location\">std::source_location</a></span></h4>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> source_location <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// source location construction</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">static</span> consteval source_location current<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> source_location<span c